msgid "Prepare a Slurm login node as a workflow host with Python environments, a Prefect login, and IBM Quantum credentials for QRMI"
msgstr "Sediakan nod log masuk Slurm sebagai hos aliran kerja dengan persekitaran Python, log masuk Prefect dan bukti kelayakan IBM Quantum untuk QRMI"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster"
msgstr "Sediakan QCSC-Prefect pada kluster Slurm"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QRMI SPANK Slurm srun sbatch PMIx plugstack slurmstepd bashrc LAPACK mkdir deps kingston marrakesh pittsburgh */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Sediakan QCSC-Prefect pada kluster Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menyediakan nod log masuk kluster Slurm sebagai hos aliran kerja qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Tutorial SQD qcsc-prefect bermula daripada hasil panduan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Selepas anda melengkapkan panduan ini, anda mempunyai item berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Lokasi | Kandungan |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Nod log masuk, hos aliran kerja | Prefect, pakej qcsc-prefect, dan arahan `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Nod pengiraan, dalam job Slurm | Pekerja QRMI: QRMI dengan arahan `task_runner`nya, dan `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Blok yang menamakan instans IBM Quantum&reg; dan QPU anda |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Nod log masuk dan nod pengiraan | Kunci API IBM Cloud&reg;, instans dan backend anda untuk QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan setiap arahan dalam terminal pada nod log masuk, kecuali langkah itu menyatakan sebaliknya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kluster Slurm dengan OpenMPI, PMIx dan pemalam QRMI SPANK, yang dipasang oleh pentadbir\n"
"kluster. Panduan berikut menerangkan komponen ini:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[Pemalam SPANK untuk QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Panduan pengguna pemalam SPANK](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Direktori utama dan direktori kerja yang dilihat oleh nod log masuk dan nod pengiraan pada\n"
"laluan mutlak yang sama\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Akses HTTPS keluar ke GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum dan Prefect Cloud dari nod log masuk,\n"
"dan ke IBM Quantum dari nod pengiraan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Akaun IBM Quantum Platform dengan kunci API IBM Cloud dan sekurang-kurangnya satu instans\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Akaun Prefect Cloud, atau pelayan Prefect yang anda hoskan sendiri\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, pengkompil C dan C++, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK dan MPI pada kluster, untuk binaan solver\n"
"dalam tutorial\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh menggunakan partition Slurm `normal` dan nod pengiraan `c1` dan `c2`. Gantikan\n"
"nama ini dengan nama kluster anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Log masuk ke nod log masuk {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Pasang uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Pasang pengurus pakej [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), dan semak pemasangan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Tetapkan laluan dan cipta direktori kerja {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini dan tutorial menggunakan dua pemboleh ubah persekitaran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pemboleh ubah | Contoh | Tujuan |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Checkout qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Direktori kerja bagi job solver dan job QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kedua-dua laluan mesti berada pada storan yang dilihat oleh nod pengiraan pada laluan mutlak yang sama. Jika\n"
"kluster anda tidak mempunyai direktori `/shared`, pilih laluan kongsi yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan pemboleh ubah, dan cipta direktori kerja. Tetapkan semula pemboleh ubah dalam setiap\n"
"shell baharu sebelum anda mengikuti tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menetapkan pemboleh ubah dalam setiap shell baharu secara automatik, tambahkannya pada `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Klon qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Klon repositori, dan checkout tag keluaran, contohnya `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Langkah 5: Cipta persekitaran aliran kerja {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Cipta persekitaran aliran kerja dengan Python 3.12, dan aktifkannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasang pakej qcsc-prefect. Pilihan `--no-deps` mengekalkan pin versi yang tepat\n"
"antara pakej checkout. Tutorial memasang aliran kerja itu sendiri:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa arahan tersedia:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan `~/venv/qcsc-host` dalam setiap shell baharu pada nod log masuk.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Langkah 6: Log masuk ke Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Log masuk ke Prefect Cloud. Pilih **Paste an API key**, tampal kunci API Prefect Cloud, dan\n"
"pilih ruang kerja anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Semak sambungan. Output menunjukkan `PREFECT_API_URL` dan ruang kerja anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pilihan: gunakan pelayan Prefect anda sendiri\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Langkau nota ini jika anda menggunakan Prefect Cloud. Untuk menggunakan pelayan Prefect anda sendiri dan bukannya Prefect\n"
"Cloud, ikuti\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"dan tetapkan alamat pelayan anda sebagai ganti `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Langkah 7: Simpan kelayakan IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan `qcsc-qrmi login` selepas log masuk Prefect, kerana ia menyimpan blok `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Jawab gesaan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Tampal kunci API IBM Cloud anda. Kunci tidak dipaparkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Tekan Enter untuk menggunakan semua instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nombor instance lalai, `1` dalam contoh berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masukkan nombor atau nama Backend lalai, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) dalam\n"
"contoh berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perintah ini juga mencetak nota tentang nod pengiraan dan baris `[qrmi]` untuk\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, yang tidak dimasukkan dalam contoh (`...`). Anda tidak memerlukan baris `[qrmi]`,\n"
"kerana aliran kerja membaca instance dan Backend daripada blok `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Perintah `qcsc-qrmi` mempunyai subperintah berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perintah | Tujuan |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Simpan kunci API, instance, dan Backend, serta simpan blok |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Cari semula instance dan Backend dengan kunci yang disimpan |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Cetak instance dan Backend, tanpa kunci |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Semak bahawa instance blok boleh menggunakan Backend-nya |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Pasang fail pada nod pengiraan {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pemalam SPANK membaca `qrmi_config.json` pada setiap nod pengiraan, daripada laluan dalam\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, selalunya `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Minta pentadbir kluster anda\n"
"memasang `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` anda pada laluan itu. Pasang semula selepas setiap\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` atau `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kekalkan **Session Mode** bagi blok `qrmi-runtime` pada `batch`, kerana pemalam SPANK\n"
"memperoleh QPU dalam batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Langkah 8: Cipta persekitaran nod pengiraan {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pekerja QRMI berjalan pada nod pengiraan, dalam persekitarannya sendiri. Cipta daripada\n"
"checkout yang sama. Pilihan `--python` mengekalkan `~/venv/qcsc-host` aktif:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej `qrmi[ibm]` menyediakan perintah `task_runner`. Tutorial ini menambah cangkuk\n"
"penyusunan SQD pada persekitaran ini, dan menggunakan `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` sebagai\n"
"`python_executable` bagi `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Langkah 9: Sahkan persediaan {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa blok `qrmi-runtime` wujud:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Semak instance dan Backend yang disimpan. Perintah ini tidak pernah mencetak kunci:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa instance lalai boleh menggunakan Backend lalai:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa Slurm menjalankan tugas pada kedua-dua nod pengiraan, juga dengan PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Semak persekitaran nod pengiraan dan direktori kerja pada nod pengiraan. Perintah\n"
"pertama tidak mencetak apa-apa apabila import berjaya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"untuk memilih nod, rank, dan thread bagi tugas penyelesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
